# MedReach Bootstrap Variant — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit real keys.

# Backend API URL (default: http://localhost:4000)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000

# Google Maps JavaScript API Key
# 1. Visit Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Select or create your project.
# 3. Enable ONLY "Maps JavaScript API" under APIs & Services > Library.
# 4. Create an API key under APIs & Services > Credentials.
# 5. (Recommended) Restrict the key to HTTP referrers (e.g., http://localhost:3000/* and your production domain).
# 6. Paste the key below:
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional: Custom Google Map ID (configured with Map Styles in Cloud Console)
# Defaults to "DEMO_MAP_ID" if unset.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID=
